{"id": "fu_05", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_f99c24ed7bb7", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_5ba5ff71eb45", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "留存曲线是通过观察用户在投放后持续使用产品的情况随时间变化的图形，用于判断投放效果和用户粘性。", "summary": "留存曲线 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_7f86257c1ae0", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "次留比七留更重要，因为次留影响留存曲线的后半段，直接影响用户的长期使用和付费意愿。", "summary": "次留 重 于 七留", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_06", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_75e3be58749f", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_57056d1aac27", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "出价策略就是决定在竞价系统里怎么出价，比如按次数、按效果或者按位置来定价格。", "summary": "出价策略 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_105835e458a8", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "手动出价适合需求明确、想控价的场景；自动出价适合追求效率、希望系统优化投放的场景。", "summary": "手动vs自动出价", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_07", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_67e19fd2dac3", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_3a012f495f28", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "CPI是每次安装所花费的平均成本，用于衡量获取用户效率及整体投放效果。", "summary": "CPI 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_3fd207244042", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "LTV是用户预计一生能带来多少收入，相当于为用户支付的平均成本乘以预期使用周期。", "summary": "LTV 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
