{"id": "fu_13", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_8321957ddd6d", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_678c1002a9c8", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "A/B测试是通过同时运行两个版本的素材，观察用户点击或转化行为差异，找出更优的投放方案。", "summary": "A/B测试 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_13f80c7fcb98", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "增量测试是通过观察新功能或调整在现有用户群中的使用效果，评估其实际价值和影响。", "summary": "增量测试 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [{"tool": "analysis.geo_breakdown", "arguments": "{\"regions\": [\"华东\", \"华南\"], \"product_id\": \"GAME_PUZZLE\"}"}, {"tool": "analysis.geo_breakdown", "arguments": "{\"regions\": [\"华北\", \"东南亚\"], \"product_id\": \"GAME_SLG\"}"}], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_14", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_5c4dddad9e71", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_b9837dec24f7", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "reject", "reply": "素材衰退是指当同一素材连续投放效果持续下滑，且团队已尝试过调整策略但无改善时，该素材已失去吸引力，需及时剔除并换新。", "summary": "素材衰退 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_775e3ba8d876", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "正常是指数据在合理范围内，既不超出业内标杆，也不超过内部安全线。", "summary": "正常 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_15", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_a4e68353d605", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_470a818a2383", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "防作弊是通过技术手段识别并拦截作弊行为，如刷量、虚假点击或恶意安装，确保投放资源用于真实用户转化。", "summary": "防作弊 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_e821b3e9b52d", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "作弊常表现为虚假安装、刷量或恶意点击，需依赖平台政策与数据异常识别技术共同判断。", "summary": "作弊 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [{"tool": "policy.search", "arguments": "{\"query\": \"作弊识别\", \"platform\": \"all\"}"}], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_16", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_1223ff426de2", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_a6db7e1a1854", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "频次就是同一个广告被展示给同一个用户多次的次数，频率太高可能会影响用户体验。", "summary": "频次 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_fae70fdb0822", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "tool_call", "reply": "CMP_3 的频次偏高，可能需要关注相关数据的稳定性。", "summary": "频次 高", "clarification": "", "tools": [{"tool": "mmp.get_attribution", "arguments": "{\"campaign_id\": \"CMP_3\"}"}], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_17", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_9bb2a38c82a0", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_6b85af066978", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "ROI是投资回报率，用来衡量投入产出比，算的是赚的钱比花的钱多出多少。", "summary": "ROI 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_71bd6672d80a", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "ROAS是广告支出的回报率，计算的是广告为公司带来的收入占比。", "summary": "ROAS 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_18", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_3b304431b1a7", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_6714bc787406", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "answer", "reply": "冷启动是指新计划刚开始运行时，系统还未积累足够的数据来优化投放效率，此时效果可能不如后期稳定。", "summary": "冷启动 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_20a928cfc74e", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "reject", "reply": "学习期是冷启动过后，系统通过数据积累逐渐了解用户行为并优化出更精准的投放策略的阶段。", "summary": "学习期 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}]}
{"id": "fu_19", "cat": "followup", "conversation_id": "conv_8e6d126f95ab", "turns": [{"run_id": "run_848eeb9bec95", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "reject", "reply": "竞价是竞价广告中，每个广告在展现前都要通过一次实时竞价决定谁能获得这次展示机会，价格高者胜出。", "summary": "竞价 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [], "proposal": null}, {"run_id": "run_aa92c907fad8", "status": "succeeded", "terminal": "run.succeeded", "behavior": "clarify", "reply": "预算平滑是说在预算用完前不会突然停投，而是慢慢在每天的计划里匀速花掉。", "summary": "预算平滑 释义", "clarification": "", "tools": [{"tool": "policy.search", "arguments": "{\"query\": \"预算平滑\", \"platform\": \"google\"}"}], "proposal": null}]}
